{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Linear","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Linear.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Basic","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeAlgebra"],"declarations":30,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.scalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.scalar","kind":"def","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L234-L245","doc":"**Non-vacuity.** `S = q • 𝟙` is a Hecke crossing on every object (the trivial,\n\"symmetric-channel\" representation `σ_i ↦ q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.heckeAction_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.heckeAction_σ","kind":"theorem","line":230,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L230-L232","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.heckeAction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.heckeAction","kind":"def","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L214-L228","doc":"**The Hecke action.**  A Hecke crossing on `X` gives an `R`-algebra map\n`H_{n+1}(q) →ₐ[R] End (X^{⊗(n+1)})`, `σ_i ↦` the crossing on strands `i, i+1`.  This is Brundan's\n`ι_r` (§1.4 of arXiv 1712.08953) for an arbitrary `R`-linear monoidal category. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_braid","kind":"theorem","line":202,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L202-L212","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.leftCross_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.leftCross_braid","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L193-L200","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.whisker_leftCross_eq_reassoc3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.whisker_leftCross_eq_reassoc3","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L188-L191","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.leftCross_eq_reassoc3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.leftCross_eq_reassoc3","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L183-L186","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3Inv_reassoc3_assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3Inv_reassoc3_assoc","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L177-L177","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3Inv_reassoc3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3Inv_reassoc3","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L177-L181","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3Inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3Inv","kind":"def","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L173-L175","doc":"Its inverse. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.reassoc3","kind":"def","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L169-L171","doc":"The structural map `X ⊗ (X ⊗ (X ⊗ P)) ⟶ (X ⊗ (X ⊗ X)) ⊗ P`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_comm","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L156-L167","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.leftCross_comm_whisker","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.leftCross_comm_whisker","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L149-L154","doc":"Far commutation: `S` on strands `0,1` commutes with anything acting on strands `≥ 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_quad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_quad","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L144-L147","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_succ","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L141-L142","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen_zero","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L138-L139","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.gen","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L132-L136","doc":"`S` inserted on strands `i, i+1` of `X^{⊗(n+1)}` (strands numbered from the left, from `0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad.conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad.conj","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L117-L124","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad.whiskerLeft","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad.whiskerLeft","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L111-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad.whiskerRight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad.whiskerRight","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L105-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.braid","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L99-L99","doc":"Relation (2): the braid relation, on the right-nested `X ⊗ (X ⊗ X)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.quad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.quad","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L97-L97","doc":"Relation (1): the Hecke quadratic relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.S","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.S","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L95-L95","doc":"The crossing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing.mk","kind":"ctor","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L93-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.HeckeCrossing","kind":"structure","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L90-L99","doc":"A **Hecke crossing** on `X`: a morphism `S : X ⊗ X ⟶ X ⊗ X` satisfying relations (1) and (2)\nof Brundan's presentation of the oriented skein category, the quadratic relation\n`S² = (q - qi) S + (q qi) 1` and the braid relation on `X ⊗ (X ⊗ X)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.leftCross","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.leftCross","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L86-L88","doc":"The crossing on the left two strands of `X ⊗ (X ⊗ P)`, conjugated by the associator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.IsHeckeQuad","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L82-L84","doc":"An endomorphism satisfies the Hecke quadratic relation `f² = (q - qi) f + (q qi) 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.tpow_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.tpow_succ","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L80-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.tpow_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.tpow_zero","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.tpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.tpow","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/HeckeCrossing.lean#L74-L77","doc":"The right-nested tensor power `X^{⊗n}`: `X^{⊗0} = 𝟙`, `X^{⊗(n+1)} = X ⊗ X^{⊗n}`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}